{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongliu-e-o147","title":"《襄阳记》记董恢副费祎使吴","accounts":[{"id":"dongliu-a-35712db9a2e885e7d963","label":"裴注·襄阳记","text":"《襄阳记》所记：董恢副费祎使吴。裴松之对其教答及任官细节提出异说与疑问。","evidence":["dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79","dongliu-q2-bb92ee4cdc9d46b0699b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongliu-p0010","role":"入蜀，以宣信中郎副费祎使吴","evidence":["dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0051","role":"奉使吴，董恢为其副","evidence":["dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79","source_order":[39,187,21],"order":7212}],"persons":[{"id":"dongliu-p0010","name":"董恢","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0051","name":"费祎","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-749a783a42c4063c4c79","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-6d40e1c899febcc21925","layer":"pei","quote":"入蜀，以宣信中郎，副费祎使吴","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a0857d4d9477a7c4acf2","start":21,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q2-bb92ee4cdc9d46b0699b","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-6d40e1c899febcc21925","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《襄阳记》曰：“董恢字休绪，襄阳人。入蜀，以宣信中郎，副费祎使吴。孙权尝大醉问祎曰：‘杨仪、魏延，牧竖小人也。虽尝有鸣吠之益于时务，然既已任之，势不得轻；若一朝无诸葛亮，必为祸乱矣！诸君愦愦，曾不知防虑于此，岂所谓贻厥孙谋乎？’祎愕然，四顾视，不能即答。恢目祎曰：‘可速言：仪、延之不协，起于私忿耳，而无黥、韩难御之心也。今方扫除强贼，混一区夏；功以才成，业由才广。若舍此不任，防其后患；是犹备有风波而逆废舟楫，非长计也。’权大笑乐。诸葛亮闻之，以为知言。还，未满三日，辟为丞相府属。迁巴郡太守。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a0857d4d9477a7c4acf2","start":0,"end":252,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
